{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S05-S06 把亲密可能留不住的痛楚具体改写成怕对方嫌自己太黏、太需要亲近，主线因此增加了被嫌弃的顾虑。\",\n    \"S07-S09 进一步把幸福感建立在对方是否需要自己、是否能从自己这里获得安心上，失去亲密也逐渐被具体化为失去对方的需要。\",\n    \"S11-S13 延续了这种对自身是否仍被需要的担忧，使故事更像是在处理害怕不再被需要、害怕被抛下的问题，而不只是亲密幸福与其无法长久之间的纠缠。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 中亲密带来的欢喜、对它终将消逝的预感、想留住它的愿望以及无法保证它长久的痛楚，始终相互牵动，Center 的两面都在共同推动变化。Y 虽然也保留了幸福与失去的痛楚，但逐渐把焦点收窄到害怕被嫌弃和不再被需要，换成了一件与 Center 接近但更具体的关系焦虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "efcbeda0-2278-472d-921d-5d365646ab7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T085010367423Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:50:24.736044+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9f5a7fa274b35ce3375f5ab9639ee1bf4499b6dc3683db225b0b430a95781d77", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we